      # The source applies a returned-row limit of 10 and asserts that all 10 rows are 'odd'. That is
      # not reproducible with `maxRows:`: STR_VALUE_INDEXED has only two distinct values, so page
      # membership depends on the tie order, which is not derivable. The full result is asserted
      # instead; paging is covered by the ForceContinuations configuration.
